.DS_Store
.Trash/

.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/cache/
.obsidian/plugins/*/data.json

# Machine-local plugin state — differs per machine, would churn between the two Macs
.claudian/

# Machine-local Obsidian UI state — re-dirties the tree on every launch
.obsidian/graph.json
.obsidian/backlink.json
.obsidian/image-converter-image-alignments.json

# Private context — NEVER commit. Secret Document lives here (essay phase).
_Private/
/_Private/

# Node (qmd / future tooling)
node_modules/

# Audio transcription scratch — raw stems, separated tracks, QC clips (~1.5 GB).
# Working data, not source: the source audio lives in "Sources/Artifacts/Audio Files/*.mp3"
# and the finished outputs in ".../Audio Files/Transcripts/*.md" (both committed).
# PATH-INDEPENDENT (`**/`) per anti-pattern #13 — must not become committable via a move.
**/_transcription_work/

# Generated external-review export — regenerate via `node _System/build-review-context.mjs`.
# NOT committed: large (~2.8 MB) and the redactions log aggregates private-referencing text.
# (The build script itself IS committed — it's the source of truth.)
# PATH-INDEPENDENT patterns (`**/`) on purpose: the 2026-06 leak happened because the
# export was MOVED into _System/_archive/, where path-exact rules stopped matching,
# and the whole set (redactions log included) got committed and pushed. Never narrow
# these back to exact paths. validate.mjs check #6 errors on any tracked-but-ignored file.
**/Vault Review Context*.md
**/Vault Review Context*/
